---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site, url } from '../data/site';
const faqs = [
  [
    'Where can I download the application?',
    'From the Download page: version 2.2.0 for Mac and a 2.2.1 Preview for Windows, each with its checksums and complete source code.',
  ],
  [
    'Do I need an account or internet connection?',
    'No account is needed. Drawing processing takes place locally. The application does not use a cloud document service.',
  ],
  [
    'Does MARK change my original PDF?',
    'No. MARK adds temporary annotations over the page. Copying or exporting creates an image, presentation or new PDF. Save the review before closing if you want to keep it.',
  ],
  [
    'Do I need Microsoft PowerPoint?',
    'No. The .pptx file is written locally; open it in any compatible presentation app. On Windows, if PowerPoint is running with a presentation open, you can also send slides straight into it.',
  ],
  [
    'Why does Office to PDF ask for LibreOffice?',
    'This conversion delegates to a locally installed LibreOffice. Install LibreOffice from its official source. Other conversions and drawing viewing do not require it.',
  ],
  [
    'How does OCR work?',
    'Locally, without any service. On Mac, Make Searchable uses Apple Vision. On Windows it uses the Tesseract engine built into the app, with seven languages included.',
  ],
  [
    'Can I use scanned PDFs and photographs?',
    'Yes. PDFs and PNG, JPEG, TIFF, BMP, GIF and WebP images open like one-page drawings. iPhone HEIC photos open on Mac, and on Windows once Microsoft’s free HEIF and HEVC extensions are installed. Scan with iPhone is Mac-only and uses Apple Continuity Camera.',
  ],
  [
    'Which Mac or Windows versions are supported?',
    'Mac: Apple silicon (M1 or newer) with macOS 14.4 or later, tested on macOS 14, 15, 26 and 27. Windows: Windows 10 or 11, 64-bit; the Windows Preview has been tested automatically on Windows Server 2022 and 2025 but not yet on an everyday PC.',
  ],
  [
    'How do I uninstall it?',
    'On Mac, drag the app to the Bin; settings, cache and logs stay in your Library under Application Support, Caches and Logs (each in an ENG Drawing Viewer folder) until you delete them. On Windows, uninstall from Settings › Apps (or delete the portable folder); settings are in %APPDATA%\\ENG Drawing Viewer and the cache and logs in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\ENG Drawing Viewer. Your drawings and saved scans stay where you saved them.',
  ],
  [
    'Can I report a bug with a confidential drawing?',
    'Please do not post private drawings to public GitHub Issues. Create a small fictional reproduction, remove identifying information, and review logs and screenshots before sharing.',
  ],
];
---

<Layout
  title="A little help, right here"
  description="Installation help, offline workflows, keyboard shortcuts and troubleshooting for ENG Drawing Viewer."
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="section-tag">SUPPORT</div>
      <h1>
        A little help.
        <br />
        <span>Right here.</span>
      </h1>
      <p>
        Answers for the everyday details, from your first drawing to your next
        presentation.
      </p>
    </header>
    <article class="page-content prose">
      <div class="faq">
        {faqs.map(([q, a]) => (
          <details>
            <summary>{q}</summary>
            <p>{a}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
      <h2>MARK keyboard shortcuts</h2>
      <p>
        Tool shortcuts are the same on Mac and Windows. Use ⌘ on Mac and Ctrl on
        Windows for standard editing commands.
      </p>
      <table class="shortcut-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Tool</th>
            <th scope="col">Shortcut</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {[
            ['Select', 'V'],
            ['Pen', 'P'],
            ['Highlighter', 'H'],
            ['Text', 'T'],
            ['Arrow', 'A'],
            ['Outline circle', 'O'],
            ['Numbered callout', 'B'],
            ['Eraser', 'E'],
            ['Undo', '⌘ / Ctrl + Z'],
            ['Save marked PDF', '⌘ / Ctrl + S'],
          ].map(([n, k]) => (
            <tr>
              <td>{n}</td>
              <td>
                <kbd>{k}</kbd>
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <h2>Still need a hand?</h2>
      <p>
        Include the app version, operating system, what you expected and the
        steps to reproduce the problem.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href={`${site.repo}/issues/new/choose`}>
        Report an issue ↗
      </a>
      <p style="margin-top:24px">
        <a href={url('download/')}>Release and installation information</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
